(8) Illegally intercepting or detaining motor vehicles, refusing to heed dissuasion, causing serious traffic congestion or significant property losses.

Where the actor has one of the circumstances in the second item or fourth item of the preceding paragraph, the motor vehicle driver's license may also be revoked; where the actor has one of the circumstances in the first item, third item, fifth item to eighth item, detention of not more than fifteen days may also be imposed.

