(2) Entrusting a motor vehicle to a person who has not obtained a motor vehicle driver's license or whose motor vehicle driver's license is revoked or suspended to drive;
(3) Escaping after causing a traffic accident, which does not yet constitute a crime;
(4) Driving a motor vehicle exceeding the prescribed speed by more than fifty percent;
