Article 36: For testing the blood alcohol content of a vehicle driver, the following procedures shall be implemented:
(1) Two traffic police officers, or one traffic police officer leading police auxiliary personnel, shall take the vehicle driver to a medical institution to extract a blood sample, or a blood sample shall be extracted on the spot by a forensic expert or other person with corresponding qualifications;
